  "text": "Assassins commit murder, either for pay or due to their belief in a cause, such as a religion or a political movement. Many are members of assassins' guilds: organizations that accept contracts to kill in return for money, favors, or both.\n\n---\nIn the underbelly of society, the lawless reign supreme."
